# Electron main / preload

## Boundaries

- DB and secrets stay in **main** (`database.ts`, `auth.ts`, `userService.ts`).
- Renderer talks only through `window.api` from `src/preload/index.ts`.
- Add IPC: register `ipcMain.handle` in main → expose `ipcRenderer.invoke` in preload → type in renderer.

## Auth & users

- Login is ADMIN-only (`auth.ts`). USER rows have no password/username requirement.
- `users:resetBiometric` clears `biometricPattern` so next LOOKUP returns SET.
- Public user DTOs must not leak password hashes; patterns may be omitted from list UIs.

## ESP + activity

- Start TCP listener with the app; status/logs via `esp:*` IPC.
- Every LOOKUP/SET/GET attempt should `logActivity` and push `activity:new`.

## Prisma notes

- SQLite URL often uses absolute `file:C:/…` under `app.getAppPath()/prisma/dev.db` on Windows.
- If `prisma generate` hits EPERM, quit Electron first (query engine DLL lock).
